{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"a2ebb3d595b8157055716cb6269b91056fdbba02979b64df39b46196c667d88b","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"dff6969913cc5c367ca64ce3c17bac2c5a005c09014b08206c0377403a7017f1","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f684bba9951a31da00912e89b7128f36b41f3f9de9fb26a05c02a385aa7ec597","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f6eee01b5c6cb1f271fc75d89a3eefae48c547688f74ce36c2436dd12b4c500b","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"跨条术语不一致：infernal-combat.lua:182 的 'as darkness' 译为「黑暗伤害」，而同批 spellblaze.lua:98（r dff69…）与 black-magic.lua:109（r f985e…）的 darkness damage 均译「暗影伤害」，两处都是 DamageType.DARKNESS。另外 183 行的条件 'damage this foe in melee while it bleeds' 被改写成「攻击被恶魔角刺穿的目标」，丢了近战限定和“流血期间”这个时间条件；182 行 '50%% of the damage done' 也丢了“按所造成伤害的比例”，只剩「额外 50%%」。"},{"revision_key":"f746ce383c99a894c47eae49642fea81e4e4eef6aa07ab9aeb3bb4c7851b6db6","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"demon.lua:191 这段模板文本里其他代词都用 <?=player:he_she()?>/his_her()，但译文「他的隐身和暗影爆炸」把代词写死成“他”，女性角色读到的会是错误性别。同一行还有几处语义偏离：'Our standard alterations have synergized with this Shalore's natural reactive magic … creating a frustratingly evasive target' 被译成「调整了永恒精灵天赋的加速能力…并在传送后大幅提升闪避能力」，原文没有“加速”，也没有“传送后”这个时序；'the resilience alterations we gave him' 被改成「在恶魔空间的试炼增强了…韧性」，改变了施加者和缘由；'poisons, flames, and the like' 泛化成「异常状态」。193 行 'beat him until he stops moving'（打到不再动弹）被译成「直到其放弃移动」，语义被弱化了。"},{"revision_key":"f985ec15c0e74b000f2c53c446ae031863c5380c3c5571fecea61fc668bd8c22","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"black-magic.lua:109 写的是 'consume up to %s stacks'，%s 来自 t.getStack，是上限；译文「消耗 %s 层叠加效果」删掉了“至多”，把上限说成了固定消耗量。目标层数少于上限时，这句描述就与实际不符。"},{"revision_key":"f9e45b5a07f183a9cfc235c7c297bcae9241401501d525dcebf352a013529121","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"fb23faa260fe36060448347769b43adfb59c638b396e35d872e83d697f041b70","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"fb28924d4a15b046f9b7dc2e79e8d7a1be8115c3a7ef765ee9bda1699598cf59","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"fc65680ae71975db706e553602b380b0367fb65908fa3eb1337972cdba325596","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"demon.lua:309 的 'Remember to pay tribute to the Water Imp' 意思是“向其致敬、铭记其功绩”，后文也在讲别忘了它们的无私牺牲；译文「随时为小水怪们奉上礼物」把它误解成送礼。另外 'As our scouts and servants beneath the seas' 只译成「使者」，丢了“斥候”这一职能；'a prime location for carrying out covert operations' 被译成「我们的藏身的主要根据地」，丢了“开展秘密行动”的语义，句子本身也不通顺。"},{"revision_key":"fc8cdfb222461f4a6e14e3f90d16a948aa1b5d0a1ce546453c04a3cfed733c98","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"fc9cbd524311de441f779442fd89649e3c0f6aeae513ee0bfe308b97c286df95","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"fdf0fd691326294033f7e2583c45117e795c0c37c517ae8818a68b78b69c1df5","verdict":"OK"}]}